{"step_index":10911,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-26T14:13:14Z","thinking":"Directly embedding the DOM for the monitoring view within the main HTML structure offers a native implementation. This eliminates common issues associated with iframes, ensuring a smoother user experience. The display of the explorer and monitor views will be controlled dynamically by button clicks, which then triggers the Chart.js graph to be rendered.\n\n\nThe monitoring view DOM will be directly integrated, replacing the iframe for instantaneous rendering of all visual elements, including charts, CPU metrics, and process lists. The explorer view's visibility will be toggled by button clicks, hiding the monitor view to display file system contents, and vice-versa. Maintaining a persistent header with key interactive elements, including a CPU pulse, ensures continuous access to performance information and resource management.\n\n\nThe monitoring view structure is defined, encompassing time range selection, metric toggles for CPU, RAM and combined views, and a dedicated canvas for the resource chart.  A graph report card will display the latest data point, CPU and RAM usage, and the top two applications. Application resource usage will be rolled up in section three, and live process details with search and sort functionality in section four.  The `switchHomeTab('monitor')` function handles view toggling, status updates, and data fetching on activation. Style conflicts between `monitor.html` and the main layout need careful evaluation.\n\n\nThe component CSS scopes appear well-defined, suggesting a modular design. Verification requires confirming `Chart.js` loads correctly within the integrated HTML structure and functions as expected. Initial testing will use Node to confirm the external library's parsing behavior, after confirming that `Chart` exists on the `window`.\n\nCareful HTML construction will be necessary.  The structure will include the title bar with live CPU data, a left navigation sidebar, and distinct views for file exploration and resource monitoring, with the resource monitor fully integrated.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"bn\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no\">\n  <title>Windows 11 Home · This PC & CPU Live Monitor (Azure VM)</title>\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Segoe+UI:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <script src=\"/chart.min.js\"></script>\n  <script>\n    if (typeof Chart === 'undefined') {\n      document.write('<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js\"><\\/script>');\n    }\n  </script>\n  <style>\n    :root {\n      --bg-base: #18181b;\n      --bg-surface: #27272a;\n      --bg-sidebar: #1f1f23;\n      --bg-header: #141416;\n      --bg-card: #181b20;\n      --bg-hover: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\n      --bg-selected: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);\n      --border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n      --border-card: #30363d;\n      --text-main: #f4f4f5;\n      --text-muted: #a1a1aa;\n      --text-bright: #ffffff;\n      --accent-blue: #60cdff;\n      --accent-fill: #0078d4;\n      --progress-bg: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);\n      --radius-sm: 4px;\n      --radius-md: 8px;\n      --radius-lg: 12px;\n      --font-family: 'Segoe UI', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, \"Noto Sans Bengali\", sans-serif;\n      --green: #2ea043;\n      --yellow: #f0883e;\n      --red: #f85149;\n      --purple: #bc8cff;\n    }\n\n    * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n      user-select: none;\n      -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    }\n\n    body {\n      font-family: var(--font-family);\n      background: #09090b;\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      height: 100vh;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      overflow: hidden;\n    }\n\n    .win11-window {\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      height: 100vh;\n      background: var(--bg-base);\n      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n      box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);\n    }\n\n    /* Windows 11 Title Bar */\n    .title-bar {\n      height: 46px;\n      background: var(--bg-header);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      padding: 0 12px;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n      gap: 12px;\n      flex-shrink: 0;\n    }\n\n    .title-left {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 12px;\n      flex: 1;\n      overflow-x: auto;\n    }\n\n    .brand-logo {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 8px;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      color: #fff;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n      flex-shrink: 0;\n    }\n\n    /* THE 2 PRIMARY BUTTONS IN WINDOWS 11 HOME */\n    .home-buttons-bar {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 8px;\n    }\n\n    .home-nav-btn {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 8px;\n      background: #27272a;\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);\n      padding: 6px 14px;\n      border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n      font-size: 12px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      transition: all 0.18s ease;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .home-nav-btn:hover {\n      background: var(--bg-hover);\n      color: #fff;\n      border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);\n    }\n    .home-nav-btn.active {\n      background: var(--accent-fill);\n      color: #fff;\n      border-color: var(--accent-blue);\n      box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(0, 120, 212, 0.5);\n    }\n    .home-nav-btn svg { width: 16px; height: 16px; flex-shrink: 0; }\n\n    .pulse-dot {\n      width: 8px;\n      height: 8px;\n      background: var(--green);\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--green);\n      animation: pulse-anim 1.5s infinite;\n      flex-shrink: 0;\n    }\n    @keyframes pulse-anim {\n      0% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }\n      50% { transform: scale(1.3); opacity: 0.5; }\n      100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }\n    }\n\n    .live-cpu-pill {\n      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);\n      padding: 2px 7px;\n      border-radius: 10px;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: var(--yellow);\n    }\n\n    .title-controls {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      flex-shrink: 0;\n    }\n\n    .win-btn {\n      width: 44px;\n      height: 38px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n      cursor: pointer;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      transition: background 0.15s;\n    }\n    .win-btn:hover { background: var(--bg-hover); color: #fff; }\n    .win-btn.close:hover { background: #e81123; color: #fff; }\n\n    /* Address Bar Area (Explorer Mode) */\n    .address-bar-area {\n      height: 42px;\n      background: var(--bg-header);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      padding: 0 12px;\n      gap: 8px;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n      flex-shrink: 0;\n    }\n\n    .nav-btn {\n      width: 32px;\n      height: 32px;\n      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      cursor: pointer;\n      background: transparent;\n      border: none;\n    }\n    .nav-btn:hover:not(:disabled) { background: var(--bg-hover); }\n    .nav-btn:disabled { opacity: 0.3; cursor: not-allowed; }\n    .nav-btn svg { width: 14px; height: 14px; fill: currentColor; }\n\n    .breadcrumbs-box {\n      flex: 1;\n      height: 32px;\n      background: var(--bg-surface);\n      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      padding: 0 8px;\n      gap: 4px;\n      overflow-x: auto;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n\n    .crumb-pill {\n      font-size: 12px;\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      padding: 2px 6px;\n      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n      cursor: pointer;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 4px;\n    }\n    .crumb-pill:hover { background: var(--bg-hover); }\n    .crumb-arrow { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 10px; }\n\n    .search-box {\n      width: 240px;\n      height: 32px;\n      background: var(--bg-surface);\n      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      padding: 0 10px;\n      gap: 6px;\n    }\n    .search-input {\n      background: transparent;\n      border: none;\n      outline: none;\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      font-size: 12px;\n      width: 100%;\n      font-family: inherit;\n    }\n    .search-input::placeholder { color: var(--text-muted); }\n\n    /* Workspace Body */\n    .workspace-body {\n      flex: 1;\n      display: flex;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      position: relative;\n    }\n\n    /* Left Sidebar */\n    .sidebar {\n      width: 230px;\n      background: var(--bg-sidebar);\n      border-right: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      padding: 8px 6px;\n      overflow-y: auto;\n      flex-shrink: 0;\n    }\n\n    .sidebar-section { margin-bottom: 12px; }\n\n    .sidebar-title {\n      font-size: 11px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n      padding: 6px 10px;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n    }\n\n    .sidebar-item {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 10px;\n      padding: 6px 10px;\n      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n      font-size: 12px;\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      cursor: pointer;\n      transition: background 0.1s;\n    }\n    .sidebar-item:hover { background: var(--bg-hover); }\n    .sidebar-item.active { background: var(--bg-selected); font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent-blue); }\n    .sidebar-item svg { width: 16px; height: 16px; flex-shrink: 0; }\n\n    /* Explorer Content Area */\n    .explorer-content-area {\n      flex: 1;\n      background: var(--bg-base);\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      overflow-y: auto;\n      padding: 14px 18px;\n    }\n\n    .drives-grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr));\n      gap: 14px;\n      margin-bottom: 20px;\n    }\n\n    .drive-card {\n      background: var(--bg-surface);\n      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n      border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n      padding: 12px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 14px;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      transition: all 0.15s;\n    }\n    .drive-card:hover {\n      background: var(--bg-hover);\n      border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);\n      transform: translateY(-1px);\n    }\n\n    .drive-icon { width: 44px; height: 44px; flex-shrink: 0; }\n    .drive-details { flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; }\n    .drive-name { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-main); }\n\n    .progress-bar-container {\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 6px;\n      background: var(--progress-bg);\n      border-radius: 3px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n    }\n\n    .progress-fill {\n      height: 100%;\n      background: var(--accent-blue);\n      border-radius: 3px;\n    }\n    .progress-fill.warning { background: var(--yellow); }\n    .progress-fill.danger { background: var(--red); }\n\n    .drive-meta { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-muted); }\n\n    .section-header {\n      font-size: 13px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      margin-bottom: 10px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n    }\n\n    /* File List Table (Details View) */\n    .files-container {\n      flex: 1;\n      overflow-y: auto;\n      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n      border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n      background: var(--bg-surface);\n    }\n\n    .files-table {\n      width: 100%;\n      border-collapse: collapse;\n      font-size: 12px;\n    }\n\n    .files-table th {\n      text-align: left;\n      padding: 8px 12px;\n      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n      font-weight: 500;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n      position: sticky;\n      top: 0;\n      z-index: 2;\n    }\n\n    .files-table tr {\n      cursor: pointer;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);\n      transition: background 0.1s;\n    }\n    .files-table tr:hover { background: var(--bg-hover); }\n    .files-table tr.selected { background: var(--bg-selected); }\n\n    .files-table td {\n      padding: 7px 12px;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n      color: var(--text-main);\n    }\n\n    .col-name {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 10px;\n      font-weight: 500;\n    }\n\n    .file-icon { width: 18px; height: 18px; flex-shrink: 0; }\n\n    /* Grid View */\n    .files-grid-view {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(110px, 1fr));\n      gap: 12px;\n      padding: 14px;\n      overflow-y: auto;\n      flex: 1;\n    }\n\n    .grid-item {\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      align-items: center;\n      padding: 10px 6px;\n      border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n      cursor: pointer;\n      text-align: center;\n      border: 1px solid transparent;\n      transition: all 0.12s;\n    }\n    .grid-item:hover { background: var(--bg-hover); border-color: var(--border-color); }\n    .grid-item.selected { background: var(--bg-selected); border-color: var(--accent-blue); }\n\n    .grid-item .file-icon { width: 44px; height: 44px; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n    .grid-item .item-title {\n      font-size: 11px;\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      word-break: break-all;\n      display: -webkit-box;\n      -webkit-line-clamp: 2;\n      -webkit-box-orient: vertical;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      line-height: 1.3;\n    }\n\n    /* ========================================================= */\n    /* VIEW 2: FULL EXACT LIVE RESOURCE & CPU MONITOR STYLES      */\n    /* ========================================================= */\n    .monitor-view-container {\n      flex: 1;\n      display: none;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      background: #0d1117;\n      overflow-y: auto;\n      padding: 16px;\n      color: #c9d1d9;\n    }\n\n    .mon-header {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      align-items: center;\n      padding: 8px 4px;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-card);\n      margin-bottom: 14px;\n    }\n    .mon-header h1 {\n      font-size: 1.15rem;\n      color: var(--text-bright);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 8px;\n    }\n    .mon-pulse {\n      width: 10px;\n      height: 10px;\n      background: var(--green);\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--green);\n      animation: pulse-anim 1.5s infinite;\n    }\n    .time-badge {\n      font-size: 0.75rem;\n      background: var(--border-card);\n      padding: 4px 8px;\n      border-radius: 12px;\n      color: var(--text-bright);\n    }\n\n    /* Section 1: Metrics Grid */\n    .mon-grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n      gap: 12px;\n      margin-bottom: 16px;\n    }\n    @media(min-width: 600px) {\n      .mon-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }\n    }\n    .mon-card {\n      background: #161b22;\n      border: 1px solid var(--border-card);\n      border-radius: 12px;\n      padding: 14px;\n    }\n    .mon-card-title {\n      font-size: 0.85rem;\n      color: #c9d1d9;\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      margin-bottom: 8px;\n    }\n    .mon-card-val {\n      font-size: 1.6rem;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: var(--text-bright);\n      margin-bottom: 6px;\n    }\n    .mon-bar-bg {\n      background: #21262d;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      height: 8px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      position: relative;\n    }\n    .mon-bar-fill {\n      height: 100%;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      transition: width 0.4s ease;\n    }\n    .mon-sub-text {\n      font-size: 0.75rem;\n      color: #8b949e;\n      margin-top: 6px;\n    }\n    .mon-core-grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);\n      gap: 6px;\n      margin-top: 8px;\n    }\n    .mon-core-item {\n      background: #21262d;\n      padding: 4px;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n    .mon-core-lbl { font-size: 0.65rem; color: #8b949e; }\n    .mon-core-val { font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-bright); }\n\n    /* Section 2: Chart Section */\n    .chart-section-card {\n      background: #161b22;\n      border: 1px solid var(--border-card);\n      border-radius: 12px;\n      padding: 14px;\n      margin-bottom: 20px;\n      position: relative;\n    }\n    .chart-card-header { margin-bottom: 8px; }\n    .chart-title-row {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      align-items: center;\n      margin-bottom: 8px;\n    }\n    .chart-title {\n      font-size: 0.95rem;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: var(--text-bright);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 6px;\n    }\n    .chart-sub-tag {\n      font-size: 0.72rem;\n      background: #21262d;\n      color: var(--accent-blue);\n      padding: 3px 8px;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n    }\n\n    .pills-scroll {\n      display: flex;\n      gap: 6px;\n      overflow-x: auto;\n      padding: 4px 2px 8px 2px;\n      margin-bottom: 6px;\n    }\n    .pill {\n      flex-shrink: 0;\n      background: #21262d;\n      border: 1px solid var(--border-card);\n      color: #8b949e;\n      padding: 5px 12px;\n      border-radius: 16px;\n      font-size: 0.78rem;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      transition: all 0.2s ease;\n    }\n    .pill.active {\n      background: var(--accent-blue);\n      color: #0d1117;\n      border-color: var(--accent-blue);\n    }\n\n    .mode-row {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      align-items: center;\n      margin-bottom: 6px;\n      flex-wrap: wrap;\n      gap: 6px;\n    }\n    .mode-pills { display: flex; gap: 4px; }\n    .mode-pill {\n      background: #161b22;\n      border: 1px solid var(--border-card);\n      color: #c9d1d9;\n      padding: 4px 10px;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      font-size: 0.72rem;\n      cursor: pointer;\n    }\n    .mode-pill.active {\n      background: #30363d;\n      color: var(--text-bright);\n      font-weight: 600;\n      border-color: #8b949e;\n    }\n    .mode-hint { font-size: 0.7rem; color: #8b949e; }\n\n    .chart-wrapper {\n      position: relative;\n      height: 240px;\n      width: 100%;\n      margin-top: 4px;\n      margin-bottom: 10px;\n    }\n\n    .graph-report-card {\n      background: #0d1117;\n      border: 1px solid var(--border-card);\n      border-radius: 10px;\n      padding: 12px;\n      margin-top: 6px;\n    }\n    .graph-report-top {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      align-items: center;\n      margin-bottom: 8px;\n      padding-bottom: 6px;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid #21262d;\n    }\n    .graph-report-badge {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 6px;\n      font-size: 0.75rem;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      color: var(--text-bright);\n    }\n    .report-badge-dot {\n      width: 8px;\n      height: 8px;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      background: var(--green);\n      display: inline-block;\n    }\n    .graph-report-time {\n      font-size: 0.75rem;\n      color: #8b949e;\n      background: #161b22;\n      padding: 2px 8px;\n      border-radius: 4px;\n      border: 1px solid var(--border-card);\n    }\n    .graph-report-metrics {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n      gap: 10px;\n      margin-bottom: 10px;\n    }\n    .graph-metric-col {\n      background: #161b22;\n      padding: 8px 10px;\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      border: 1px solid #21262d;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n    }\n    .g-metric-lbl {\n      font-size: 0.65rem;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 0.4px;\n      color: #8b949e;\n      margin-bottom: 2px;\n    }\n    .g-metric-val { font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 800; }\n    .val-cpu { color: var(--yellow); }\n    .val-ram { color: var(--accent-blue); }\n\n    .graph-top-apps-box {\n      background: #161b22;\n      border: 1px solid #21262d;\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      padding: 8px 10px;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 6px;\n    }\n    .g-apps-header {\n      font-size: 0.7rem;\n      color: #8b949e;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid #21262d;\n      padding-bottom: 4px;\n      margin-bottom: 2px;\n    }\n    .g-app-row {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 6px;\n      font-size: 0.8rem;\n      flex-wrap: wrap;\n    }\n    .g-app-tag {\n      font-size: 0.62rem;\n      padding: 2px 5px;\n      border-radius: 4px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n    }\n    .rank-1 { background: #3d2c00; color: #f0883e; border: 1px solid #6e4e00; }\n    .rank-2 { background: #1c2d42; color: #58a6ff; border: 1px solid #264a73; }\n    .g-app-name {\n      font-weight: 600;\n      color: var(--text-bright);\n      flex: 1;\n      min-width: 110px;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      text-overflow: ellipsis;\n    }\n    .g-app-vals {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 6px;\n      font-size: 0.78rem;\n      font-weight: 600;\n    }\n    .graph-report-footer {\n      font-size: 0.68rem;\n      color: #8b949e;\n      text-align: center;\n      margin-top: 8px;\n    }\n\n    /* Section 3: App Rollup */\n    .mon-section-title {\n      font-size: 0.95rem;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      color: var(--text-bright);\n      margin: 20px 0 10px 4px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n    }\n    .mon-app-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }\n    .mon-app-card {\n      background: #161b22;\n      border: 1px solid var(--border-card);\n      border-radius: 10px;\n      padding: 12px;\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      align-items: center;\n    }\n    .mon-app-info {\n      flex: 1;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 2px;\n      min-width: 0;\n      padding-right: 8px;\n    }\n    .mon-app-name {\n      font-size: 0.88rem;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      color: var(--text-bright);\n      white-space: nowrap;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      text-overflow: ellipsis;\n    }\n    .mon-app-count { font-size: 0.72rem; color: #8b949e; }\n    .mon-app-cols { display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: center; text-align: right; }\n    .mon-col-item { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-end; min-width: 65px; }\n    .mon-col-hdr { font-size: 0.65rem; text-transform: uppercase; color: #8b949e; letter-spacing: 0.3px; }\n\n    /* Section 4: Processes */\n    .mon-controls { display: flex; gap: 8px; margin: 12px 0; }\n    .mon-search-box {\n      flex: 1;\n      background: #161b22;\n      border: 1px solid var(--border-card);\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      padding: 8px 12px;\n      color: var(--text-bright);\n      font-size: 0.85rem;\n      outline: none;\n    }\n    .mon-btn-group { display: flex; gap: 4px; }\n    .mon-btn {\n      background: #21262d;\n      border: 1px solid var(--border-card);\n      color: #c9d1d9;\n      padding: 8px 12px;\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      font-size: 0.8rem;\n      cursor: pointer;\n    }\n    .mon-btn.active {\n      background: var(--accent-blue);\n      color: #0d1117;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      border-color: var(--accent-blue);\n    }\n    .mon-proc-card {\n      background: #161b22;\n      border: 1px solid var(--border-card);\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      padding: 10px;\n      margin-bottom: 6px;\n      font-size: 0.8rem;\n    }\n    .mon-proc-top {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      color: var(--text-bright);\n      margin-bottom: 4px;\n    }\n    .mon-proc-tag {\n      font-size: 0.72rem;\n      color: var(--purple);\n      background: #2b1f3d;\n      padding: 2px 6px;\n      border-radius: 4px;\n    }\n    .mon-proc-cmd {\n      font-size: 0.72rem;\n      color: #8b949e;\n      font-family: monospace;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      text-overflow: ellipsis;\n    }\n    .mon-proc-metrics { display: flex; gap: 12px; font-size: 0.78rem; margin-top: 4px; }\n\n    /* Status Bar */\n    .status-bar {\n      height: 26px;\n      background: var(--bg-header);\n      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      padding: 0 14px;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n      flex-shrink: 0;\n    }\n\n    /* Notepad / Code Preview Modal */\n    .modal-overlay {\n      position: fixed;\n      top: 0;\n      left: 0;\n      right: 0;\n      bottom: 0;\n      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.75);\n      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);\n      z-index: 1000;\n      display: none;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      padding: 20px;\n    }\n    .modal-overlay.active { display: flex; }\n\n    .win11-notepad {\n      width: 900px;\n      max-width: 95vw;\n      height: 600px;\n      max-height: 85vh;\n      background: #1e1e1e;\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);\n      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n      box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85);\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      overflow: hidden;\n    }\n\n    .notepad-header {\n      height: 38px;\n      background: #252526;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      padding: 0 14px;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n    }\n    .notepad-title {\n      font-size: 12px;\n      font-weight: 500;\n      color: #fff;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 8px;\n    }\n    .notepad-body {\n      flex: 1;\n      padding: 12px;\n      overflow: auto;\n      background: #181818;\n      font-family: 'Consolas', 'Courier New', monospace;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      line-height: 1.5;\n      color: #d4d4d4;\n      white-space: pre-wrap;\n      word-break: break-all;\n    }\n    .notepad-footer {\n      height: 36px;\n      background: #252526;\n      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      padding: 0 14px;\n    }\n    .btn-action {\n      background: var(--accent-fill);\n      color: #fff;\n      border: none;\n      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n      padding: 5px 12px;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      font-weight: 500;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 6px;\n    }\n    .btn-action:hover { background: #0078d4; }\n\n    .mobile-menu-btn {\n      display: none;\n      background: transparent;\n      border: none;\n      color: #fff;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      padding: 4px;\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 768px) {\n      .sidebar {\n        position: absolute;\n        top: 0;\n        bottom: 0;\n        left: -250px;\n        z-index: 100;\n        transition: left 0.25s ease;\n      }\n      .sidebar.open { left: 0; }\n      .mobile-menu-btn { display: block; }\n      .search-box { width: 130px; }\n      .home-nav-btn span.btn-label-long { display: none; }\n      .drives-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"win11-window\">\n  <!-- Title Bar with EXACTLY THE 2 PRIMARY BUTTONS -->\n  <div class=\"title-bar\">\n    <div class=\"title-left\">\n      <button class=\"mobile-menu-btn\" onclick=\"toggleSidebar()\" title=\"Toggle Sidebar\">\n        <svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M3 18h18v-2H3v2zm0-5h18v-2H3v2zm0-7v2h18V6H3z\"/></svg>\n      </button>\n\n      <!-- Brand Logo -->\n      <div class=\"brand-logo\" onclick=\"switchHomeTab('explorer')\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\">\n          <rect x=\"4\" y=\"6\" width=\"40\" height=\"28\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#0078d4\"/>\n          <rect x=\"7\" y=\"9\" width=\"34\" height=\"22\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#1b1b1b\"/>\n          <path d=\"M12 14h10v10H12z\" fill=\"#00adf2\"/>\n          <path d=\"M26 14h10v10H26z\" fill=\"#0078d4\"/>\n          <path d=\"M18 34h12v4H18z\" fill=\"#808080\"/>\n          <path d=\"M14 38h20v3H14z\" fill=\"#a0a0a0\"/>\n        </svg>\n        <span>Windows 11 Home</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- THE 2 PRIMARY BUTTONS REQUESTED BY IRAK BHAI -->\n      <div class=\"home-buttons-bar\">\n        <!-- BUTTON 1: This PC (ফাইল এক্সপ্লোরার) -->\n        <button class=\"home-nav-btn active\" id=\"btnTabExplorer\" onclick=\"switchHomeTab('explorer')\" title=\"Windows 11 File Explorer\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#60cdff\"><path d=\"M10 4H4c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v12c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h16c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V8c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2h-8l-2-2z\"/></svg>\n          <span>This PC <span class=\"btn-label-long\">(ফাইল এক্সপ্লোরার)</span></span>\n        </button>\n\n        <!-- BUTTON 2: রিসোর্স ও CPU মনিটর -->\n        <button class=\"home-nav-btn\" id=\"btnTabMonitor\" onclick=\"switchHomeTab('monitor')\" title=\"Live Resource & CPU Activity Monitor\">\n          <span class=\"pulse-dot\"></span>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#f0883e\"><path d=\"M3.5 18.49l6-6.01 4 4L22 6.92l-1.41-1.41-7.09 7.97-4-4L2 16.99z\"/></svg>\n          <span>রিসোর্স ও CPU মনিটর</span>\n          <span class=\"live-cpu-pill\" id=\"headerCpuBadge\">0.0%</span>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Window Controls -->\n    <div class=\"title-controls\">\n      <div class=\"win-btn\" title=\"Minimize\">&#8211;</div>\n      <div class=\"win-btn\" title=\"Maximize\">&#9633;</div>\n      <div class=\"win-btn close\" title=\"Close\">&times;</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Address & Search Bar (Visible in File Explorer mode) -->\n  <div class=\"address-bar-area\" id=\"explorerAddressBar\">\n    <button class=\"nav-btn\" id=\"btnBack\" onclick=\"goBack()\" title=\"Back\" disabled>\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M20 11H7.83l5.59-5.59L12 4l-8 8 8 8 1.41-1.41L7.83 13H20v-2z\"/></svg>\n    </button>\n    <button class=\"nav-btn\" id=\"btnForward\" onclick=\"goForward()\" title=\"Forward\" disabled>\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 4l-1.41 1.41L16.17 11H4v2h12.17l-5.58 5.59L12 20l8-8z\"/></svg>\n    </button>\n    <button class=\"nav-btn\" id=\"btnUp\" onclick=\"goUp()\" title=\"Up to parent folder\" disabled>\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12l1.41 1.41L11 7.83V20h2V7.83l5.58 5.59L20 12l-8-8-8 8z\"/></svg>\n    </button>\n\n    <div class=\"breadcrumbs-box\" id=\"breadcrumbsBox\">\n      <!-- Breadcrumbs rendered dynamically -->\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"search-box\">\n      <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#a0a0a0\"><path d=\"M15.5 14h-.79l-.28-.27A6.471 6.471 0 0 0 16 9.5 6.5 6.5 0 1 0 9.5 16c1.61 0 3.09-.59 4.23-1.57l.27.28v.79l5 4.99L20.49 19l-4.99-5zm-6 0C7.01 14 5 11.99 5 9.5S7.01 5 9.5 5 14 7.01 14 9.5 11.99 14 9.5 14z\"/></svg>\n      <input type=\"text\" class=\"search-input\" id=\"searchInput\" placeholder=\"Search current folder...\" onkeyup=\"handleSearch(event)\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Workspace Body -->\n  <div class=\"workspace-body\">\n    <!-- Left Navigation Sidebar -->\n    <div class=\"sidebar\" id=\"sidebar\">\n      <div class=\"sidebar-section\">\n        <div class=\"sidebar-title\">Windows 11 Views</div>\n        <div class=\"sidebar-item active\" id=\"sideItemExplorer\" onclick=\"switchHomeTab('explorer')\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">\n            <rect x=\"4\" y=\"6\" width=\"40\" height=\"28\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#0078d4\"/>\n            <rect x=\"7\" y=\"9\" width=\"34\" height=\"22\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#1b1b1b\"/>\n            <path d=\"M18 34h12v4H18z\" fill=\"#808080\"/>\n            <path d=\"M14 38h20v3H14z\" fill=\"#a0a0a0\"/>\n          </svg>\n          <span>১. This PC (এক্সপ্লোরার)</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"sidebar-item\" id=\"sideItemMonitor\" onclick=\"switchHomeTab('monitor')\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#f0883e\"><path d=\"M3.5 18.49l6-6.01 4 4L22 6.92l-1.41-1.41-7.09 7.97-4-4L2 16.99z\"/></svg>\n          <span>২. রিসোর্স ও CPU মনিটর</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"sidebar-section\">\n        <div class=\"sidebar-title\">Quick Access</div>\n        <div class=\"sidebar-item\" onclick=\"navigateTo('/home/azureuser')\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#60cdff\"><path d=\"M10 20v-6h4v6h5v-8h3L12 3 2 12h3v8z\"/></svg>\n          <span>Azure User Home</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"sidebar-item\" onclick=\"navigateTo('/home/azureuser/IrakIroan')\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#f9e2af\"><path d=\"M10 4H4c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v12c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h16c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V8c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2h-8l-2-2z\"/></svg>\n          <span>IrakIroan Workspace</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"sidebar-item\" onclick=\"navigateTo('/home/azureuser/GCP_FULL_BACKUP')\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#fab387\"><path d=\"M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z\"/></svg>\n          <span>GCP Backup Vault</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"sidebar-item\" onclick=\"navigateTo('/home/azureuser/AGY-MASTER')\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#cba6f7\"><path d=\"M12 2L1 21h22L12 2zm0 3.5L19.5 19h-15L12 5.5z\"/></svg>\n          <span>AGY-MASTER Architecture</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"sidebar-section\">\n        <div class=\"sidebar-title\">Devices & Drives</div>\n        <div class=\"sidebar-item\" onclick=\"navigateTo('/')\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#89b4fa\"><path d=\"M2 20h20v-4H2v4zm2-3h2v2H4v-2zM2 4v4h20V4H2zm4 3H4V5h2v2zm-4 7h20v-4H2v4zm2-3h2v2H4v-2z\"/></svg>\n          <span>Local Disk (C:)</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"sidebar-item\" onclick=\"navigateTo('/home')\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#a6e3a1\"><path d=\"M2 20h20v-4H2v4zm2-3h2v2H4v-2zM2 4v4h20V4H2zm4 3H4V5h2v2zm-4 7h20v-4H2v4zm2-3h2v2H4v-2z\"/></svg>\n          <span>Data Disk (D:)</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"sidebar-section\">\n        <div class=\"sidebar-title\">Server Host</div>\n        <div class=\"sidebar-item\" style=\"cursor:default;\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#f38ba8\"><path d=\"M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm-1 17.93c-3.95-.49-7-3.85-7-7.93 0-.62.08-1.21.21-1.79L9 15v1c0 1.1.9 2 2 2v1.93zm6.9-2.54c-.26-.81-1-1.39-1.9-1.39h-1v-3c0-.55-.45-1-1-1H8v-2h2c.55 0 1-.45 1-1V7h2c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2v-.41c2.93 1.19 5 4.06 5 7.41 0 2.08-.8 3.97-2.1 5.39z\"/></svg>\n          <span>Azure VM: FatehAli</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- VIEW 1: FILE EXPLORER CONTENT AREA -->\n    <div class=\"explorer-content-area\" id=\"viewExplorer\">\n      <!-- Drives & Shortcuts (Visible on \"This PC\") -->\n      <div id=\"drivesView\" style=\"display:none;\">\n        <div class=\"section-header\">\n          <span>Devices and Drives</span>\n          <span style=\"font-size:11px; color:var(--text-muted);\">Azure Virtual Machine FatehAli</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"drives-grid\" id=\"drivesList\">\n          <!-- Drive cards rendered here -->\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"section-header\" style=\"margin-top:14px;\">\n          <span>Quick Workspace Shortcuts</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"drives-grid\">\n          <div class=\"drive-card\" onclick=\"navigateTo('/home/azureuser')\">\n            <div class=\"drive-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#60cdff\"><path d=\"M10 20v-6h4v6h5v-8h3L12 3 2 12h3v8z\"/></svg></div>\n            <div class=\"drive-details\"><div class=\"drive-name\">Azure User Home</div><div class=\"drive-meta\">/home/azureuser</div></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"drive-card\" onclick=\"navigateTo('/home/azureuser/IrakIroan')\">\n            <div class=\"drive-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#f9e2af\"><path d=\"M10 4H4c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v12c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h16c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V8c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2h-8l-2-2z\"/></svg></div>\n            <div class=\"drive-details\"><div class=\"drive-name\">IrakIroan Workspace</div><div class=\"drive-meta\">/home/azureuser/IrakIroan</div></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"drive-card\" onclick=\"navigateTo('/home/azureuser/GCP_FULL_BACKUP')\">\n            <div class=\"drive-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#fab387\"><path d=\"M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z\"/></svg></div>\n            <div class=\"drive-details\"><div class=\"drive-name\">GCP Backup Vault</div><div class=\"drive-meta\">33 GB Archive</div></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"drive-card\" onclick=\"navigateTo('/home/azureuser/IrakIroan/Google_Drive_Backup/Extracted files/mdkamruzzamanirak_gmail_com')\">\n            <div class=\"drive-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#a6e3a1\"><path d=\"M19.35 10.04C18.67 6.59 15.64 4 12 4 9.11 4 6.6 5.64 5.35 8.04 2.34 8.36 0 10.91 0 14c0 3.31 2.69 6 6 6h13c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5 0-2.64-2.05-4.78-4.65-4.96z\"/></svg></div>\n            <div class=\"drive-details\"><div class=\"drive-name\">GCP Extracted Live Files</div><div class=\"drive-meta\">577,045 Files</div></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- File Details Table View -->\n      <div class=\"files-container\" id=\"detailsViewContainer\" style=\"display:none;\">\n        <table class=\"files-table\">\n          <thead>\n            <tr>\n              <th style=\"width:40%;\">Name</th>\n              <th style=\"width:25%;\">Date modified</th>\n              <th style=\"width:20%;\">Type</th>\n              <th style=\"width:15%; text-align:right;\">Size</th>\n            </tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody id=\"filesTableBody\">\n            <!-- Files rendered here -->\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- File Grid View -->\n      <div class=\"files-grid-view\" id=\"gridViewContainer\" style=\"display:none;\">\n        <!-- Grid items rendered here -->\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- ========================================================= -->\n    <!-- VIEW 2: FULL NATIVE LIVE RESOURCE & CPU MONITOR (NO IFRAME) -->\n    <!-- ========================================================= -->\n    <div class=\"monitor-view-container\" id=\"viewMonitor\">\n      <div class=\"mon-header\">\n        <h1><span class=\"mon-pulse\"></span> লাইভ রিসোর্স ও CPU অ্যাক্টিভিটি মনিটর · Azure VM</h1>\n        <div class=\"time-badge\" id=\"last-update\">আপডেট হচ্ছে...</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Section 1: System Metrics Cards (Always Live) -->\n      <div class=\"mon-grid\">\n        <!-- CPU Card -->\n        <div class=\"mon-card\">\n          <div class=\"mon-card-title\">\n            <span>সার্বিক CPU লোড</span>\n            <span id=\"cpu-cores-text\">4 vCPUs</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"mon-card-val\" id=\"cpu-val\" style=\"color:var(--yellow);\">0.0%</div>\n          <div class=\"mon-bar-bg\">\n            <div class=\"mon-bar-fill\" id=\"cpu-bar\" style=\"width: 0%; background: var(--green);\"></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"mon-core-grid\" id=\"core-bars\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- RAM Card -->\n        <div class=\"mon-card\">\n          <div class=\"mon-card-title\">\n            <span>RAM মেমোরি (ফিজিক্যাল)</span>\n            <span id=\"ram-avail-text\">ফ্রি: 0.0 GB</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"mon-card-val\" id=\"ram-val\" style=\"color:var(--accent-blue);\">0.0 GB <span style=\"font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 400; color: #8b949e;\">/ 16.0 GB</span></div>\n          <div class=\"mon-bar-bg\">\n            <div class=\"mon-bar-fill\" id=\"ram-bar\" style=\"width: 0%; background: var(--accent-blue);\"></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"mon-sub-text\" id=\"ram-sub\">ব্যবহৃত: 0% · ফিজিক্যাল মেমোরি</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Swap Card -->\n        <div class=\"mon-card\">\n          <div class=\"mon-card-title\">\n            <span>NVMe সোয়াপ (Swap)</span>\n            <span style=\"color: var(--green);\">সক্রিয়</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"mon-card-val\" id=\"swap-val\" style=\"color:var(--purple);\">0.0 GB <span style=\"font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 400; color: #8b949e;\">/ 40.0 GB</span></div>\n          <div class=\"mon-bar-bg\">\n            <div class=\"mon-bar-fill\" id=\"swap-bar\" style=\"width: 0%; background: var(--purple);\"></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"mon-sub-text\" id=\"swap-sub\">হোস্ট: Azure VM FatehAli</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Section 2: Interactive Timeline Graph (Chart.js) -->\n      <div class=\"chart-section-card\">\n        <div class=\"chart-card-header\">\n          <div class=\"chart-title-row\">\n            <span class=\"chart-title\">📈 রিসোর্স ব্যবহারের টাইমলাইন গ্রাফ (Live Activity)</span>\n            <span class=\"chart-sub-tag\" id=\"chart-range-label\">গত ১ ঘণ্টা</span>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Time Range Pills -->\n          <div class=\"pills-scroll\">\n            <button class=\"pill\" onclick=\"changeRange('1m', this)\">1মি</button>\n            <button class=\"pill\" onclick=\"changeRange('5m', this)\">5মি</button>\n            <button class=\"pill\" onclick=\"changeRange('15m', this)\">15মি</button>\n            <button class=\"pill\" onclick=\"changeRange('30m', this)\">30মি</button>\n            <button class=\"pill active\" onclick=\"changeRange('1h', this)\">1ঘণ্টা</button>\n            <button class=\"pill\" onclick=\"changeRange('5h', this)\">5ঘণ্টা</button>\n            <button class=\"pill\" onclick=\"changeRange('10h', this)\">10ঘণ্টা</button>\n            <button class=\"pill\" onclick=\"changeRange('24h', this)\">24ঘণ্টা</button>\n            <button class=\"pill\" onclick=\"changeRange('all', this)\">সব (All)</button>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Metric View Toggles -->\n          <div class=\"mode-row\">\n            <div class=\"mode-pills\">\n              <button class=\"mode-pill active\" id=\"mode-cpu\" onclick=\"setChartMode('cpu')\">🔥 CPU ভিউ</button>\n              <button class=\"mode-pill\" id=\"mode-ram\" onclick=\"setChartMode('ram')\">💾 RAM ভিউ</button>\n              <button class=\"mode-pill\" id=\"mode-both\" onclick=\"setChartMode('both')\">📊 উভয়ই (CPU+RAM)</button>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"mode-hint\">👆 গ্রাফে মাউস/আঙুল সরালে ঠিক ওই মুহূর্তের রিপোর্ট দেখা যাবে</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Chart Canvas -->\n        <div class=\"chart-wrapper\">\n          <canvas id=\"resourceChart\"></canvas>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Graph Report Card -->\n        <div class=\"graph-report-card\" id=\"graph-report-card\">\n          <div class=\"graph-report-top\">\n            <div class=\"graph-report-badge\">\n              <span class=\"report-badge-dot\" id=\"graph-report-dot\"></span>\n              <span id=\"graph-report-status\">সর্বশেষ ডাটা পয়েন্ট</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"graph-report-time\" id=\"graph-report-time\">আপডেট হচ্ছে...</div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"graph-report-metrics\">\n            <div class=\"graph-metric-col\">\n              <span class=\"g-metric-lbl\">১ম কলাম · সার্বিক CPU</span>\n              <span class=\"g-metric-val val-cpu\" id=\"graph-cpu-val\">0.0%</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"graph-metric-col\">\n              <span class=\"g-metric-lbl\">২য় কলাম · সার্বিক RAM</span>\n              <span class=\"g-metric-val val-ram\" id=\"graph-ram-val\">0.0 GB</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"graph-top-apps-box\">\n            <div class=\"g-apps-header\">\n              <span>🎯 ওই মুহূর্তের শীর্ষ ২ অ্যাপ [১ম: CPU | ২য়: RAM]</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"g-app-row\">\n              <div class=\"g-app-tag rank-1\">শীর্ষ ১</div>\n              <div class=\"g-app-name\" id=\"graph-app1-name\">—</div>\n              <div class=\"g-app-vals\">\n                <span class=\"val-cpu\" id=\"graph-app1-cpu\">0.0% CPU</span>\n                <span style=\"color:#484f58;\">·</span>\n                <span class=\"val-ram\" id=\"graph-app1-ram\">0.0 GB RAM</span>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"g-app-row\">\n              <div class=\"g-app-tag rank-2\">শীর্ষ ২</div>\n              <div class=\"g-app-name\" id=\"graph-app2-name\">—</div>\n              <div class=\"g-app-vals\">\n                <span class=\"val-cpu\" id=\"graph-app2-cpu\">0.0% CPU</span>\n                <span style=\"color:#484f58;\">·</span>\n                <span class=\"val-ram\" id=\"graph-app2-ram\">0.0 GB RAM</span>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"graph-report-footer\" id=\"graph-report-footer\">\n            💡 গ্রাফে টাচ করে আঙুল সরালে ঠিক ওই মুহূর্তের রিপোর্ট এখানে দেখা যাবে\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Section 3: Live App Breakdown -->\n      <div class=\"mon-section-title\">\n        <span>📱 লাইভ অ্যাপভিত্তিক রিসোর্স রোলআপ</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size: 0.72rem; color: #8b949e; background: #21262d; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 6px;\">[১ম কলাম: CPU] ❖ [২য় কলাম: RAM]</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"mon-app-list\" id=\"app-list\"></div>\n\n      <!-- Section 4: Live Process List -->\n      <div class=\"mon-section-title\" style=\"margin-top: 24px;\">\n        <span>⚙️ লাইভ প্রসেস অনুযায়ী বিস্তারিত তালিকা</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size: 0.72rem; color: #8b949e; background: #21262d; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 6px;\">[১ম: CPU] · [২য়: RAM]</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"mon-controls\">\n        <input type=\"text\" class=\"mon-search-box\" id=\"search-box\" placeholder=\"প্রসেস বা সার্ভিস খুঁজুন...\" oninput=\"renderProcs()\">\n        <div class=\"mon-btn-group\">\n          <button class=\"mon-btn active\" id=\"btn-sort-cpu\" onclick=\"setSort('cpu')\">১ম: CPU ক্রমানুসারে</button>\n          <button class=\"mon-btn\" id=\"btn-sort-ram\" onclick=\"setSort('ram')\">২য়: RAM ক্রমানুসারে</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div id=\"proc-list\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Status Bar -->\n  <div class=\"status-bar\">\n    <div id=\"statusLeft\">Loading...</div>\n    <div id=\"statusRight\">Microsoft Windows 11 · Azure Cloud VM (FatehAli)</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Windows 11 Notepad / Preview Modal -->\n<div class=\"modal-overlay\" id=\"notepadModal\">\n  <div class=\"win11-notepad\">\n    <div class=\"notepad-header\">\n      <div class=\"notepad-title\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#60cdff\"><path d=\"M14 2H6c-1.1 0-1.99.9-1.99 2L4 20c0 1.1.89 2 1.99 2H18c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V8l-6-6zm2 16H8v-2h8v2zm0-4H8v-2h8v2zm-3-5V3.5L18.5 9H13z\"/></svg>\n        <span id=\"notepadFileName\">file.txt - Notepad</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"win-btn close\" onclick=\"closeNotepad()\">&times;</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"notepad-body\" id=\"notepadContent\"></div>\n    <div class=\"notepad-footer\">\n      <span id=\"notepadFileSize\" style=\"font-size:11px; color:#aaa;\">0 KB</span>\n      <div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px;\">\n        <button class=\"btn-action\" onclick=\"copyNotepadContent()\">Copy Text</button>\n        <button class=\"btn-action\" id=\"btnDownloadFile\" style=\"background:#0078d4;\">Download File</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n  let currentPath = \"THIS_PC\";\n  let historyStack = [];\n  let historyIndex = -1;\n  let viewMode = \"details\";\n  let currentItems = [];\n  let activeTab = \"explorer\"; // \"explorer\" or \"monitor\"\n\n  // Live Monitor Variables\n  let currentStats = null;\n  let currentSort = 'cpu';\n  let currentRange = '1h';\n  let currentMode = 'cpu'; // 'cpu', 'ram', 'both'\n  let historyData = [];\n  let chartInstance = null;\n  let isScrubbing = false;\n\n  const icons = {\n    folder: `<svg class=\"file-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"#f9e2af\" d=\"M10 4H4c-1.1 0-1.99.9-1.99 2L2 18c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h16c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V8c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2h-8l-2-2z\"/></svg>`,\n    zip: `<svg class=\"file-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"#f38ba8\" d=\"M19.35 10.04C18.67 6.59 15.64 4 12 4 9.11 4 6.6 5.64 5.35 8.04 2.34 8.36 0 10.91 0 14c0 3.31 2.69 6 6 6h13c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5 0-2.64-2.05-4.78-4.65-4.96zM14 13h-3v3H9v-3H6v-2h3V8h2v3h3v2z\"/></svg>`,\n    code: `<svg class=\"file-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"#89b4fa\" d=\"M9.4 16.6L4.8 12l4.6-4.6L8 6l-6 6 6 6 1.4-1.4zm5.2 0l4.6-4.6-4.6-4.6L16 6l6 6-6 6-1.4-1.4z\"/></svg>`,\n    python: `<svg class=\"file-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"#fab387\" d=\"M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm1 17.93c-3.95-.49-7-3.85-7-7.93 0-.62.08-1.21.21-1.79L9 15v1c0 1.1.9 2 2 2v1.93z\"/></svg>`,\n    markdown: `<svg class=\"file-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"#cba6f7\" d=\"M14 2H6c-1.1 0-1.99.9-1.99 2L4 20c0 1.1.89 2 1.99 2H18c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V8l-6-6zm2 16H8v-2h8v2zm0-4H8v-2h8v2zm-3-5V3.5L18.5 9H13z\"/></svg>`,\n    database: `<svg class=\"file-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"#a6e3a1\" d=\"M12 2C6.48 2 2 4.02 2 6.5s4.48 4.5 10 4.5 10-2.02 10-4.5S17.52 2 12 2zm0 7c-4.41 0-8-1.34-8-2.5S7.59 4 12 4s8 1.34 8 2.5S16.41 9 12 9zm-8 4.5c0 1.16 3.59 2.5 8 2.5s8-1.34 8-2.5V11c-1.78 1.25-4.7 2-8 2s-6.22-.75-8-2v2.5zm0 5c0 1.16 3.59 2.5 8 2.5s8-1.34 8-2.5V16c-1.78 1.25-4.7 2-8 2s-6.22-.75-8-2v2.5z\"/></svg>`,\n    generic: `<svg class=\"file-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"#bac2de\" d=\"M6 2c-1.1 0-1.99.9-1.99 2L4 20c0 1.1.89 2 1.99 2H18c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V8l-6-6H6zm7 7V3.5L18.5 9H13z\"/></svg>`\n  };\n\n  function getIcon(item) {\n    if (item.is_dir) return icons.folder;\n    const ext = item.ext.toLowerCase();\n    if (['zip', 'tar', 'gz', 'bz2', 'xz', '7z', 'rar'].includes(ext)) return icons.zip;\n    if (['py'].includes(ext)) return icons.python;\n    if (['js', 'ts', 'jsx', 'tsx', 'rs', 'go', 'java', 'c', 'cpp', 'html', 'css', 'json', 'sh'].includes(ext)) return icons.code;\n    if (['md', 'txt', 'log'].includes(ext)) return icons.markdown;\n    if (['sql', 'db', 'sqlite', 'rdb'].includes(ext)) return icons.database;\n    return icons.generic;\n  }\n\n  function getBarColor(pct) {\n    if (pct >= 70) return '#f85149';\n    if (pct >= 40) return '#f0883e';\n    return '#2ea043';\n  }\n\n  /* ========================================================= */\n  /* SWITCH BETWEEN THE 2 PRIMARY BUTTONS                      */\n  /* ========================================================= */\n  function switchHomeTab(tab) {\n    activeTab = tab;\n    const btnExp = document.getElementById('btnTabExplorer');\n    const btnMon = document.getElementById('btnTabMonitor');\n    const sideExp = document.getElementById('sideItemExplorer');\n    const sideMon = document.getElementById('sideItemMonitor');\n    const viewExp = document.getElementById('viewExplorer');\n    const viewMon = document.getElementById('viewMonitor');\n    const addrBar = document.getElementById('explorerAddressBar');\n\n    if (tab === 'monitor') {\n      btnExp.classList.remove('active');\n      btnMon.classList.add('active');\n      sideExp.classList.remove('active');\n      sideMon.classList.add('active');\n      viewExp.style.display = 'none';\n      addrBar.style.display = 'none';\n      viewMon.style.display = 'flex';\n      document.getElementById('statusLeft').textContent = 'লাইভ রিসোর্স ও CPU মনিটর সক্রিয় · রিয়েল-টাইম সিস্টেম টেলিমেট্রি';\n\n      // Fetch and draw graph\n      fetchStats();\n      fetchHistory();\n      setTimeout(() => {\n        if (chartInstance) chartInstance.resize();\n        else renderChart();\n      }, 50);\n    } else {\n      btnMon.classList.remove('active');\n      btnExp.classList.add('active');\n      sideMon.classList.remove('active');\n      sideExp.classList.add('active');\n      viewMon.style.display = 'none';\n      viewExp.style.display = 'flex';\n      addrBar.style.display = 'flex';\n      refreshCurrent();\n    }\n  }\n\n  /* Header CPU Badge Live Updater */\n  async function updateCpuBadge() {\n    try {\n      const res = await fetch('/api/stats');\n      if (!res.ok) return;\n      const data = await res.json();\n      if (data && typeof data.cpu_overall !== 'undefined') {\n        const badge = document.getElementById('headerCpuBadge');\n        badge.textContent = data.cpu_overall.toFixed(1) + '%';\n        badge.style.color = getBarColor(data.cpu_overall);\n      }\n    } catch (e) {}\n  }\n\n  /* ========================================================= */\n  /* FILE EXPLORER ENGINE                                      */\n  /* ========================================================= */\n  async function loadDrives() {\n    try {\n      const res = await fetch('/api/drives');\n      const data = await res.json();\n      const container = document.getElementById('drivesList');\n      container.innerHTML = '';\n      data.drives.forEach(d => {\n        const card = document.createElement('div');\n        card.className = 'drive-card';\n        card.onclick = () => navigateTo(d.path);\n        \n        let barClass = 'progress-fill';\n        if (d.percent > 90) barClass += ' danger';\n        else if (d.percent > 75) barClass += ' warning';\n\n        card.innerHTML = `\n          <div class=\"drive-icon\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" width=\"44\" height=\"44\">\n              <rect x=\"6\" y=\"10\" width=\"36\" height=\"28\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#0078d4\"/>\n              <rect x=\"9\" y=\"13\" width=\"30\" height=\"22\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#202020\"/>\n              <path d=\"M12 30h24v2H12z\" fill=\"#00adf2\"/>\n              <circle cx=\"35\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\" fill=\"#60cdff\"/>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"drive-details\">\n            <div class=\"drive-name\">${d.label}</div>\n            <div class=\"progress-bar-container\">\n              <div class=\"${barClass}\" style=\"width: ${d.percent || 100}%;\"></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"drive-meta\">${d.free_str} free of ${d.total_str}</div>\n          </div>\n        `;\n        container.appendChild(card);\n      });\n    } catch (e) {\n      console.error(e);\n    }\n  }\n\n  async function navigateTo(targetPath, addToHistory = true) {\n    if (activeTab === 'monitor') {\n      switchHomeTab('explorer');\n    }\n\n    if (addToHistory) {\n      if (historyIndex < historyStack.length - 1) {\n        historyStack = historyStack.slice(0, historyIndex + 1);\n      }\n      historyStack.push(targetPath);\n      historyIndex = historyStack.length - 1;\n    }\n    updateNavButtons();\n\n    currentPath = targetPath;\n    document.getElementById('statusLeft').textContent = `Loading ${targetPath}...`;\n\n    const isThisPC = (targetPath === 'THIS_PC');\n    if (isThisPC) {\n      document.getElementById('drivesView').style.display = 'block';\n      document.getElementById('detailsViewContainer').style.display = 'none';\n      document.getElementById('gridViewContainer').style.display = 'none';\n      document.getElementById('breadcrumbsBox').innerHTML = `<div class=\"crumb-pill\" onclick=\"openThisPC()\"><strong>This PC</strong></div>`;\n      document.getElementById('btnUp').disabled = true;\n      loadDrives();\n      document.getElementById('statusLeft').textContent = 'This PC · 5 Drives and Workspace Locations Ready';\n      return;\n    } else {\n      document.getElementById('drivesView').style.display = 'none';\n      if (viewMode === 'details') {\n        document.getElementById('detailsViewContainer').style.display = 'block';\n        document.getElementById('gridViewContainer').style.display = 'none';\n      } else {\n        document.getElementById('detailsViewContainer').style.display = 'none';\n        document.getElementById('gridViewContainer').style.display = 'grid';\n      }\n    }\n\n    try {\n      const res = await fetch(`/api/browse?path=${encodeURIComponent(targetPath)}`);\n      const data = await res.json();\n\n      if (data.error && !data.items) {\n        alert(\"Error: \" + data.error);\n        return;\n      }\n\n      currentItems = data.items || [];\n      renderBreadcrumbs(data.breadcrumbs || []);\n      renderFiles(currentItems);\n\n      document.getElementById('statusLeft').textContent = `${data.total_items || 0} items | Folders: ${data.total_folders || 0}, Files: ${data.total_files || 0} (${data.total_size_str || '0 B'})`;\n    } catch (err) {\n      document.getElementById('statusLeft').textContent = `Error loading folder`;\n      console.error(err);\n    }\n  }\n\n  function renderBreadcrumbs(crumbs) {\n    const box = document.getElementById('breadcrumbsBox');\n    box.innerHTML = '';\n    crumbs.forEach((c, idx) => {\n      const pill = document.createElement('div');\n      pill.className = 'crumb-pill';\n      pill.textContent = c.name;\n      pill.onclick = () => navigateTo(c.path);\n      box.appendChild(pill);\n\n      if (idx < crumbs.length - 1) {\n        const arrow = document.createElement('span');\n        arrow.className = 'crumb-arrow';\n        arrow.innerHTML = '&#9656;';\n        box.appendChild(arrow);\n      }\n    });\n  }\n\n  function renderFiles(items) {\n    const tableBody = document.getElementById('filesTableBody');\n    const gridView = document.getElementById('gridViewContainer');\n    tableBody.innerHTML = '';\n    gridView.innerHTML = '';\n\n    if (!items || items.length === 0) {\n      tableBody.innerHTML = `<tr><td colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center; padding:20px; color:#888;\">This folder is empty.</td></tr>`;\n      gridView.innerHTML = `<div style=\"grid-column:1/-1; text-align:center; padding:40px; color:#888;\">This folder is empty.</div>`;\n      return;\n    }\n\n    items.forEach(item => {\n      const tr = document.createElement('tr');\n      tr.onclick = (e) => handleItemClick(item, e);\n      tr.ondblclick = () => handleItemOpen(item);\n      tr.innerHTML = `\n        <td>\n          <div class=\"col-name\">\n            ${getIcon(item)}\n            <span>${item.name}</span>\n          </div>\n        </td>\n        <td>${item.mtime_str || '-'}</td>\n        <td>${item.type_name || '-'}</td>\n        <td style=\"text-align:right;\">${item.size_str || ''}</td>\n      `;\n      tableBody.appendChild(tr);\n\n      const card = document.createElement('div');\n      card.className = 'grid-item';\n      card.onclick = (e) => handleItemClick(item, e);\n      card.ondblclick = () => handleItemOpen(item);\n      card.innerHTML = `\n        ${getIcon(item)}\n        <div class=\"item-title\" title=\"${item.name}\">${item.name}</div>\n      `;\n      gridView.appendChild(card);\n    });\n  }\n\n  function handleItemClick(item, e) {\n    document.querySelectorAll('.files-table tr, .grid-item').forEach(el => el.classList.remove('selected'));\n    if (e.currentTarget) e.currentTarget.classList.add('selected');\n    document.getElementById('statusLeft').textContent = `Selected: ${item.name} (${item.size_str || 'Folder'})`;\n  }\n\n  function handleItemOpen(item) {\n    if (item.is_dir) {\n      navigateTo(item.path);\n    } else {\n      openFilePreview(item.path, item.name);\n    }\n  }\n\n  async function openFilePreview(filePath, fileName) {\n    const modal = document.getElementById('notepadModal');\n    const title = document.getElementById('notepadFileName');\n    const content = document.getElementById('notepadContent');\n    const size = document.getElementById('notepadFileSize');\n    const downloadBtn = document.getElementById('btnDownloadFile');\n\n    title.textContent = `${fileName} - Notepad`;\n    content.textContent = 'Loading file preview...';\n    modal.classList.add('active');\n\n    downloadBtn.onclick = () => {\n      window.open(`/api/raw?path=${encodeURIComponent(filePath)}&download=1`, '_blank');\n    };\n\n    try {\n      const res = await fetch(`/api/content?path=${encodeURIComponent(filePath)}`);\n      const data = await res.json();\n      if (data.error) {\n        content.textContent = \"Error: \" + data.error;\n      } else {\n        content.textContent = data.content;\n        size.textContent = data.size_str;\n      }\n    } catch (e) {\n      content.textContent = \"Failed to load content: \" + e;\n    }\n  }\n\n  function closeNotepad() {\n    document.getElementById('notepadModal').classList.remove('active');\n  }\n\n  function copyNotepadContent() {\n    const text = document.getElementById('notepadContent').textContent;\n    navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(() => {\n      alert(\"File content copied to clipboard!\");\n    });\n  }\n\n  function openThisPC() {\n    navigateTo('THIS_PC');\n  }\n\n  function refreshCurrent() {\n    if (currentPath === 'THIS_PC') {\n      loadDrives();\n    } else {\n      navigateTo(currentPath, false);\n    }\n    updateCpuBadge();\n  }\n\n  function goBack() {\n    if (historyIndex > 0) {\n      historyIndex--;\n      navigateTo(historyStack[historyIndex], false);\n      updateNavButtons();\n    }\n  }\n\n  function goForward() {\n    if (historyIndex < historyStack.length - 1) {\n      historyIndex++;\n      navigateTo(historyStack[historyIndex], false);\n      updateNavButtons();\n    }\n  }\n\n  function goUp() {\n    if (currentPath === '/' || currentPath === 'THIS_PC') return;\n    const parts = currentPath.split('/').filter(Boolean);\n    parts.pop();\n    const parent = parts.length === 0 ? '/' : '/' + parts.join('/');\n    navigateTo(parent);\n  }\n\n  function updateNavButtons() {\n    document.getElementById('btnBack').disabled = (historyIndex <= 0);\n    document.getElementById('btnForward').disabled = (historyIndex >= historyStack.length - 1);\n    document.getElementById('btnUp').disabled = (currentPath === '/' || currentPath === 'THIS_PC');\n  }\n\n  function toggleSidebar() {\n    document.getElementById('sidebar').classList.toggle('open');\n  }\n\n  function handleSearch(e) {\n    const query = e.target.value.toLowerCase().trim();\n    if (!query) {\n      renderFiles(currentItems);\n      return;\n    }\n    const filtered = currentItems.filter(x => x.name.toLowerCase().includes(query));\n    renderFiles(filtered);\n  }\n\n  /* ========================================================= */\n  /* LIVE RESOURCE & CPU MONITOR ENGINE (100% NATIVE)          */\n  /* ========================================================= */\n  function changeRange(range, el) {\n    currentRange = range;\n    document.querySelectorAll('.pills-scroll .pill').forEach(p => p.classList.remove('active'));\n    if (el) el.classList.add('active');\n    const 